```yaml
xcpgir_version: "1.0"
rule:
  id: "tainted-file-path"
  kind: taint
  severity: ERROR
  message: "Detected user input controlling a file path. An attacker could control the location of this file, to include going backwards in the directory with '../'. To address this, ensure that user-controlled variables in file paths are sanitized. You may also consider using a utility method such as org.apache.commons.io.FilenameUtils.getName(...) to only retrieve the file name from the path."
  metadata:
    language: java
    category: security
    tags:
      - java
      - spring
    cwe: "CWE-23: Relative Path Traversal"
    owasp: "A01:2021 - Broken Access Control"

sources:
  - id: USER_INPUT
    match:
      node: METHOD_PARAMETER_IN
      where:
        - op: regex
          left: type
          right: ^(?!(Integer|Long|Float|Double|Char|Boolean|int|long|float|double|char|boolean))
        - op: regex
          left: annotation
          right: (RequestBody|PathVariable|RequestParam|RequestHeader|CookieValue|ModelAttribute)

sinks:
  - id: FILE_OPERATION
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: java.io.File
        method: <init>
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: java.io.FileReader
        method: <init>
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: java.io.FileInputStream
        method: <init>
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: java.nio.file.Paths
        method: get
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: java.lang.Class
        method: getResource
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: java.lang.Class
        method: getResourceAsStream
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils
        method: getFile
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: org.apache.commons.io.FileUtils
        method: openOutputStream

sanitizers:
  - id: FILENAME_UTILS
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: org.apache.commons.io.FilenameUtils
        method: getName
    effect: neutralize

propagations:
  - id: METHOD_ARG_TO_PARAM
    edge: arg->param
    kind: taint
```
Valid: ```yaml
issues:
  - "sinks部分缺少对ClassPathResource和StreamSource的匹配定义，可能导致漏报"
  - "改进建议：在sinks部分增加对javax.xml.transform.StreamSource和org.springframework.core.io.ClassPathResource的匹配"

  - "sources部分缺少对方法参数内部的具体处理限定（如parameter_in类型限定）"
  - "改进建议：在sources的match部分增加对METHOD_PARAMETER_IN的具体匹配条件"

  - "sanitizers部分缺少对effect和scope的具体定义"
  - "改进建议：明确sanitizer的作用范围和效果类型，如添加effect: neutralize和scope: {sinks: [FILE_OPERATION]}"
```
